 smiling baby sleeping peacefully on a white background, with the ComfortPuff Diapers name and logo prominently displayed at the bottom. The baby's skin is healthy and glowing, reflecting the nourishing properties of the diaper.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"platform\": \"Digital\",\n      \"description\": \"A dynamic video of a baby playing and smiling, with ComfortPuff Diapers being placed on the baby's bottom. The video highlights the diaper's flexibility and absorption power, with a close-up of the star-shaped fluff and aloe vera liner.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"platform\": \"TV\",\n      \"description\": \"A warm and inviting commercial featuring a variety of babies sleeping, playing, and smiling while wearing ComfortPuff Diapers. The commercial emphasizes the diaper's comfort, absorption, and skin-nourishing benefits, with a voiceover detailing the key features and benefits.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```", "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -0.35488778352737427}, {"token": "json", "logprob": -7.331102824537084e-05}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "{", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -2.4914430468925275e-05}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "advert", "logprob": -0.3367367386817932}, {"token": "isement", "logprob": -0.0003319427778478712}, {"token": "\":", "logprob": -0.0010270564816892147}, {"token": " {", "logprob": -2.992108420585282e-05}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "   ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -3.933898824470816e-06}, {"token": "product", "logprob": -0.20273970067501068}, {"token": "_name", "logprob": -0.01451857015490532}, {"token": "\":", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -1.8358061424805783e-05}, {"token": "Com", "logprob": -0.2841958701610565}, {"token": "fort", "logprob": -0.5488545298576355}, {"token": "P", "logprob": -0.6743743419647217}, {"token": "uff", "logprob